<title>USA: Jefferson Cty BOE, Ala., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Jefferson Cty BOE, Ala., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan &amp; Co, Inc said it won $9.045 million of Jefferson County Board of Education, Ala., capital outlay warrants, Series 1997-A, with a net interest cost of 5.735 percent.</p>
</text>
